{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いて下さりありがとうございます🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 増本綺良です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thシングルが発売となりました✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうゲットした方いらっしゃるかなー？💿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色んなタイプの楽曲が入っているので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても楽しんで頂けると思います！ぜひチェックしてみてください🌸"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/355/34cb8580c958175d34a55c989d48e.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "CDTVライブ!ライブ!さんに出演させていただきました🏠"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "森田さんが写真誘ってくれた♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "胴上げ4メートルくらい上がっててかっこよかったよ✨"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/355/34cb8580c958175d34a55c989d48e-01.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "家族っぽい髪型にしてみた"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/355/34cb8580c958175d34a55c989d48e-02.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天さん可愛い"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/355/34cb8580c958175d34a55c989d48e-03.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "教えてくれるドラマ全部おもろい"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/355/34cb8580c958175d34a55c989d48e-04.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVのれなさんの髪型めっちゃ可愛かった"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/355/34cb8580c958175d34a55c989d48e-05.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れいちゃん♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うちわに猫耳してくれてる🐱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MV、ご覧いただけましたかー？👀"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/355/34cb8580c958175d34a55c989d48e-06.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この時、スタッフさんとお話してて現場出るのが最後になってしまったんですけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", 